obs Home Employment and Jobs Home Offices & Services In This Section Offices & Services Employment and Jobs Faculty & Staff Positions Student Positions Business Office Conferencing & Events Services Information Technology (CCIT) Marketing & Communications Mailroom Thank you for your interest in employment at Carroll College in Helena, Montana. The lifeblood of Carroll College's faculty and staff is our commitment to the success of our students.  Carroll is proud to promote a positive work environment and offers a comprehensive compensation and benefits package to employees that include unique benefits such as tickets to home athletic events, rental of outdoor equipment, access to the campus workout facility, potential tuition remission, and exchange opportunities, and more.  Carroll also offers very generous holiday and paid leave benefits. The Carroll community is enriched by the opportunities we have to learn from diverse perspectives, experiences, and backgrounds. We are committed to embracing and expanding those opportunities as a core part of the Carroll experience. That commitment is rooted in our very identity. As a proudly Catholic, diocesan institution of higher education, we are firmly committed to the dignity of every person. And our educational foundation in the liberal arts—where multiple perspectives are key—invites diversity of thought. Finally, diversity in our living and learning community is essential to prepare students to succeed in a multicultural world. Find Employment at Carroll College Faculty & Staff Positions Student Positions Questions about Employment? Office of Human Resources Carroll College 1601 North Benton Avenue Helena, MT 59625 Karla Weltz- Director of Human Resources (406) 447-5501 ~ kweltz@carroll.edu Jennifer Bingham - Associate Director of Human Resources (406) 447-5502 ~ jbingham@carroll.edu Find Employment at Carroll College Faculty & Staff Positions Student Positions Close Modal Explore the Causes Close Carroll College Quick Links Accessibility Athletics Bookstore Carroll Apps Login Report Incident/Concern Connect with Carroll Contact Us Map & Directions Careers Directory Offices & Services YouTube Instagram Facebook X Linked In 1601 N Benton Ave. Helena, MT 59625 800.992.3648 406.447.4300 Support Carroll © Carroll College 2026 Footer utility menu Title IX Accessibility Consumer Information Privacy Policy Login Search search Submit Search We use cookies on this site to enhance your user experience by clicking any link on this page you are giving your consent for us to set cookies. Policy OK, got it"
